# Class: obo:IDO_0000479 (infectious disease incidence)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:IDO_0000479 "A quality that inheres in an organism population and is the number of realizations of an infectious disease for which the infectious disease course begins during a specified period of time."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000479 "Albert Goldfain")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000479 "Alexander Diehl")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000479 "Lindsay Cowell")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:IDO_0000479 "A particular instance of infectious disease incidence will depend on a type of infectious disease, a population, and a period of time.  Incidence is used as a measure of risk.  Actual measures of incidence are based only on reported cases and usually specify a time interval and geographic location.  Other constraints may include population demographics.  These constraints will vary with the context of the incidence measure.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:IDO_0000479 "infectious disease incidence"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:IDO_0000479 obo:BFO_0000019)

# Class: obo:IDO_0000480 (infection incidence)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:IDO_0000480 "A quality that inheres in an organism population and is the number of organisms in the population that become infected with an infectious agent during a specified period of time."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000480 "Albert Goldfain")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000480 "Alexander Diehl")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000480 "Lindsay Cowell")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:IDO_0000480 "A particular instance of infection incidence will depend on a type of infectious agent, a population, and a period of time.  Incidence is used as a measure of risk.  Actual measures of incidence are based only on reported cases and usually specify a time interval and geographic location.  Other constraints may include population demographics.  These constraints will vary with the context of the incidence measure.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:IDO_0000480 "infection incidence"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:IDO_0000480 obo:BFO_0000019)

# Class: obo:IDO_0000481 (infectious disease incidence proportion)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:IDO_0000481 "A quality that inheres in an organism population and is the proportion of members of the population not experiencing an infectious disease course at the beginning of a specified period of time and in whom the infectious disease begins during the specified period of time. "@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000481 "Albert Goldfain")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000481 "Alexander Diehl")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000481 "Lindsay Cowell")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000118 obo:IDO_0000481 "cumulative incidence of infectious disease"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:IDO_0000481 "An instance of infectious disease incidence proportion is measured by dividing a measure of an instance of infectious disease incidence by the number of members of the population in which the infectious disease course had not begun at the beginning of the specified period of time over which the incidence was measured.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:IDO_0000481 "infectious disease incidence proportion"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:IDO_0000481 obo:BFO_0000019)

# Class: obo:IDO_0000482 (infection incidence proportion)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:IDO_0000482 "A quality that inheres in an organism population and is the proportion of members of the population not infected at the beginning of a specified period of time who become infected during the specified period of time. "@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000482 "Albert Goldfain")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000482 "Alexander Diehl")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000482 "Lindsay Cowell")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000118 obo:IDO_0000482 "cumulative incidence of infection"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:IDO_0000482 "An instance of infection incidence proportion is measured by dividing a measure of an instance of infection incidence by the number of members of the population not infected at the beginning of the specified period of time over which the incidence was measured.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:IDO_0000482 "infection incidence proportion"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:IDO_0000482 obo:BFO_0000019)

# Class: obo:IDO_0000483 (infectious disease incidence rate)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:IDO_0000483 "A quality that inheres in an organism population and is the infectious disease incidence proportion per unit time."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000483 "Albert Goldfain")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000483 "Alexander Diehl")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000483 "Lindsay Cowell")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:IDO_0000483 "An instance of infectious disease incidence rate is measured by dividing a measure of an instance of the infectious disease incidence proportion by the length of the period of time over which the incidence was measured.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:IDO_0000483 "infectious disease incidence rate"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:IDO_0000483 obo:BFO_0000019)

# Class: obo:IDO_0000484 (infection incidence rate)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:IDO_0000484 "A quality that inheres in an organism population and is the infection incidence proportion per unit time."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000484 "Albert Goldfain")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000484 "Alexander Diehl")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000484 "Lindsay Cowell")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:IDO_0000484 "An instance of infection incidence rate is measured by dividing a measure of an instance of infection incidence proportion by the length of the period of time over which the incidence was measured.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:IDO_0000484 "infection incidence rate"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:IDO_0000484 obo:BFO_0000019)

# Class: obo:IDO_0000485 (infectious disease prevalence)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:IDO_0000485 "A quality that inheres in an organism population and is the number of realizations of an infectious disease in the population at a specified time."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000485 "Albert Goldfain")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000485 "Alexander Diehl")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000485 "Lindsay Cowell")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:IDO_0000485 "Prevalence is sometimes defined as a proportion with total population size in the denominator.  A particular instance of infectious disease prevalence will depend on a type of infectious disease, a population, and a period of time.  Actual measures of prevalence are based only on reported cases and usually specify a time interval and geographic location.  Other constraints may include population demographics.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:IDO_0000485 "infectious disease prevalence"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:IDO_0000485 obo:BFO_0000019)

# Class: obo:IDO_0000486 (infection prevalence)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:IDO_0000486 "A quality that inheres in an organism population and is the number of organisms in the population infected with an infectious agent at a specified time."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000486 "Albert Goldfain")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000486 "Alexander Diehl")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000486 "Lindsay Cowell")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:IDO_0000486 "Prevalence is sometimes defined as a proportion with total population size in the denominator.  A particular instance of infection prevalence will depend on a type of infectious agent, a population, and a period of time.  Actual measures of prevalence are based only on reported cases and usually specify a time interval and geographic location.  Other constraints may include population demographics.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:IDO_0000486 "infection prevalence"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:IDO_0000486 obo:BFO_0000019)

# Class: obo:IDO_0000487 (infectious disease lifetime prevalence)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:IDO_0000487 "A quality that inheres in an organism population and is the number of organisms in the population who have, at any point during their lives, been bearers of an infectious disease and experienced realization of the disease."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000487 "Albert Goldfain")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000487 "Alexander Diehl")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000487 "Lindsay Cowell")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:IDO_0000487 "Prevalence is sometimes defined as a proportion with total population size in the denominator.  A particular instance of infectious disease lifetime prevalence will depend on a type of infectious disease and a population.  Actual measures of prevalence are based only on reported cases and usually specify a geographic location.  Other constraints may include population demographics.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:IDO_0000487 "infectious disease lifetime prevalence"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:IDO_0000487 obo:BFO_0000019)

# Class: obo:IDO_0000488 (infectious agent seroprevalence)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:IDO_0000488 "A quality that inheres in an organism population and is the number of organisms in the population that have antibody specific for an infectious agent in their serum at a specified time."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000488 "Albert Goldfain")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000488 "Alexander Diehl")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000488 "Lindsay Cowell")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:IDO_0000488 "Prevalence is sometimes defined as a proportion with total population size in the denominator.  A particular instance of infectious agent seroprevalence will depend on a type of infectious agent and a population.  Actual measures of seroprevalence are based only on tested individuals and usually specify a geographic location.  Other constraints may include population demographics.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:IDO_0000488 "infectious agent seroprevalence"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:IDO_0000488 obo:BFO_0000019)

# Class: obo:IDO_0000489 (infectious disease mortality rate)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:IDO_0000489 "A quality that inheres in an organism population and is the per capita number of deaths in the population resulting from an infectious disease over a specified period of time."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000489 "Albert Goldfain")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000489 "Alexander Diehl")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000489 "Lindsay Cowell")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:IDO_0000489 "A particular instance of infectious disease mortality rate will depend on a type of infectious disease and a population.  Actual measures of mortality rate are based only on reported cases and usually specify a geographic location.  Other constraints may include population demographics.  Mortality rate is typically expressed in units of deaths per 1000 individuals per year.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:IDO_0000489 "infectious disease mortality rate"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:IDO_0000489 obo:BFO_0000019)

# Class: obo:IDO_0000623 (communicability)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:IDO_0000623 "An infectious disposition to be transmitted directly from one organism to another of the same Species by horizontal transmission."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000623 "Albert Goldfain")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000623 "Alexander Diehl")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000623 "Lindsay Cowell")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:IDO_0000623 "The disposition is realized in a direct, horizontal transmission process between members of the same Species.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:IDO_0000623 "communicability"@en)


)